# Deterministic LF checkouts on every platform (overrides core.autocrlf).
#
# Three things here compare bytes on disk and break under CRLF conversion:
# the zavet dialect golden tests (cli/core/tests/zavet_dialect.rs), the
# drift-gated contract artifacts (plain `git diff` in CI), and the vendored
# installer sync to the landing repo (byte-identity per D-0007). install.sh
# additionally must stay LF to run under sh/WSL from a Windows clone.
# PowerShell (install.ps1) reads LF-only scripts fine, 5.1 included.
* text=auto eol=lf
